<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">October 31, 2024</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">Dear Shareholder:</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">On behalf of the Board of Directors and Management of Electra Battery Materials
Corporation (&ldquo;<B>Electra</B>&rdquo; or the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;), we would like to invite you to attend the special meeting
of shareholders (the &ldquo;<B>Meeting</B>&rdquo;):</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
