                                                                                                                 <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD>&nbsp;</TD><TD>&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
                                                                                                                 <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 1.75in"><U>Location</U>:</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Cassels Brock &amp; Blackwell LLP, Suite 3200, Bay Adelaide Centre, North Tower, 40 Temperance Street,
Toronto, Ontario, M5H 0B4</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">The enclosed management proxy circular (the &ldquo;<B>Circular</B>&rdquo;)
contains information about voting instructions and the business of the meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">All Shareholders are strongly encouraged to vote in advance of the Meeting
using the proxy form or the voting instruction form provided to them with the Meeting materials.</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">Your participation in the affairs of the Company is important to us. Please
take this opportunity to exercise your vote, either virtually at the meeting or by completing and returning your proxy form.</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">We appreciate your support and we will continue to work for your interests.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

